    <p><em>MSME Direct (hereinafter, referred to as “we,” “our,” “us”, “MSME Direct”) takes data privacy seriously. We recognise and value the trust that our prospective clients, clients, service providers, vendors, suppliers, and individuals place in us when providing us with personal data and we are committed to safeguarding the privacy and security of personal data we may collect from our clients, service providers, vendors, suppliers, and individuals / other entities to whom we provide our services. This data privacy and protection policy is published to fulfil our obligations under applicable privacy laws in India. The applicable privacy laws are as follows:</em></p>

    <ol>
