    <p>By providing your personal data to us (whether via one of our websites, mobile application, by email, in person or over the phone), you agree to the processing of your personal data as set out in this Data Privacy and Protection Policy. Further notices highlighting certain uses we wish to make of your personal data together with the ability to opt in or out of selected uses may also be provided to you when we collect personal data from you.</p>

    <h4>1. Who we are and what we do</h4>
    <p>We are a unique platform dedicated towards facilitating connections between you and the service providers. Our website and/or mobile application serves as a bridge, allowing you to efficiently search for relevant services while connecting you with the right service providers.</p>

    <h4>2. What personal data we collect about you</h4>
    <p>We may collect and process different types of personal data of our prospective clients, clients, vendors suppliers and service providers in the course of operating our business and providing our services. These include:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Basic personal details such as your name, gender, age, location;</li>
        <li>Contact data such as your telephone number and postal or email address;</li>
        <li>Financial data such as payment related information or bank account details;</li>
        <li>Website and/or mobile application usage and other technical data such as details of your visits to our website(s) and/or mobile application;</li>
        <li>Password used for during registration or sign-up process into the website and/or mobile application; and/or</li>
        <li>Any other personal data relating to you that you may provide.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>During registration or sign-up process, you may be required to provide relevant organizational data including the organization’s name, type, and business category, as well as details on its MSME classification, description of specialization, years of experience, and contact information such as phone number, address, and email address. Additionally, you may be required to identification numbers such as the GST number, PAN number, and Udyam Aadhar number, alongside the relevant government issued identification documents.</p>

    <h4>3. How we obtain the personal data about you</h4>
    <p>We may collect or receive your personal data in a number of different ways:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Where you provide it to us directly, for example by corresponding with us by email, or via other direct interactions with us such as completing a form on our website and/or mobile application or registering for our updates and newsletters;</li>
        <li>Where we monitor use of, or interactions with, our websites and/or mobile application, any updates or newsletters we may send to you, or other email communications sent from or received by us;</li>
        <li>Where we receive information about you during the course of our engagement with you while providing our services; or</li>
        <li>Publicly available sources - we may, for example, use publicly available sources to help us keep the contact details we already hold for you accurate and up to date or for professional networking purposes, e.g. LinkedIn or social media like Facebook and Twitter.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>4. How we use your personal data</h4>
