<p><strong>Consent:</strong> where you have consented to our use of your personal data and information (by visiting our website and/or mobile application, and/or signing up for our services you have consented to the collection, use, processing, and storage of the data and personal information provided to us by you. Further, you may choose to withdraw your consent, at any time, by writing to us at the contact information provided in section 11 (hereinbelow). In case you choose to withdraw your consent according to the privacy policy, we may restrict/limit your access to the website and/or mobile application.</p>
